{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Elie</strong> who's 16 years old. A teenager with no story, curious, a bit of a dreamer, a fan of video games. He (she...?) loves spending his  afternoons role-playing with his two best friends, <strong>Gab</strong> and <strong>Medie</strong>. Elie lives in Sector G with his mother and little sister, who can be a bit of a handful (but at this age, that's only to be expected).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around Elie seems ordinary. People go to work, deal with their daily worries... In short, everything is normal (well, the Zeings aren't but that's another matter). One day, your life changes as\u00a0<strong>someone contacts you</strong>\u00a0on Messenger Plus!. A strange person suddenly tells you the one thing every potential hero has always heard before: \u201c<strong><i>you're the only one who can change the course of things</i></strong><i>\u201d</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>why you</strong>? And above all... <strong>are you ready to trust them? </strong>This game is brought to you by a team of dedicated developers from Canada. 2 years of hard work, no AI whatsoever, all original content created by a group of RPG loving game developers :-). We hope you'll enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/a54b823c3dea9a1e8ec385cea7a75c74.poster.avif?t=1773680172\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/a54b823c3dea9a1e8ec385cea7a75c74.webm?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/a54b823c3dea9a1e8ec385cea7a75c74.mp4?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pluralys is a world that is both familiar and profoundly strange. There, you will encounter <strong>beings from elsewhere</strong>, living among humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do we still have to find out about them? Do they intend to settle on your planet forever? Can some of them be your friend? All of them? That may be up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/99572c37d85b0e669b072cb6ac5ed081.poster.avif?t=1773680172\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/99572c37d85b0e669b072cb6ac5ed081.webm?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/99572c37d85b0e669b072cb6ac5ed081.mp4?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious person who contacted you has entrusted you with a strange device: <strong>the Pager</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique tool is capable of freezing time and revealing details no one else can see. <br>With it, you can analyze people, move objects far too heavy for a teenager, hack into security systems, and much more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b1b09a1eefaed63a921b79c3d94f0b5d.poster.avif?t=1773680172\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b1b09a1eefaed63a921b79c3d94f0b5d.webm?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/b1b09a1eefaed63a921b79c3d94f0b5d.mp4?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, not every situation requires a pager (tell that to people in the 90s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pluralys is a living world, full of <strong>challenges big and small, as well as several mini-games</strong> scattered throughout your journey: choose wisely, solve puzzles, confront enigmas\u2026 this game is full of interactions that will let you explore the world in new and surprising ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/20668920993cfaf4620aeee6fee70e04.poster.avif?t=1773680172\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/20668920993cfaf4620aeee6fee70e04.webm?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/20668920993cfaf4620aeee6fee70e04.mp4?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will sometimes be peaceful, sometimes filled with obstacles, but it will always take you through <strong>varied, warm, and unexpected environments</strong>: quiet residential areas, lively bazaars, vast deserts, mysterious laboratories\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has its own story and each one brings you a little closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/3c86453943f66e16157ce77fb6b2b181.poster.avif?t=1773680172\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/3c86453943f66e16157ce77fb6b2b181.webm?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/extras/3c86453943f66e16157ce77fb6b2b181.mp4?t=1773680172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative is at the heart of Pluralys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you will encounter short cinematic scenes sometimes touching, sometimes funny, sometimes mysterious that deepen the relationship between characters and reveal more about the world\u2019s hidden stakes. There's no combat in this game, only choices that matter.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let's have an adventure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"Love of butter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"Taste of literature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/bdca1cc219cc2eb8d510745a4702c00d6f51672a.jpg"},{"name":"From Closet to Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/bdca1cc219cc2eb8d510745a4702c00d6f51672a.jpg"},{"name":"Family's best friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"Bird is the word","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"First contact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"Bathrooms are for crying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"And... scene!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"},{"name":"When the hero travels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275440/045d51ac8faf08c3d463fc1da9af1b169ca0bfeb.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275440?t=1773680172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/61cfd576f28e06f8cac930cf0b5c54c04cea9879/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773680172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/d14f5a800f068f2862d57dd75200bfb6da7cd006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773680172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275440/d14f5a800f068f2862d57dd75200bfb6da7cd006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773680172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3722750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Elie</strong> who's 16 years old. A teenager with no story, curious, a bit of a dreamer, a fan of video games. He (she...?) loves spending his  afternoons role-playing with his two best friends, <strong>Gab</strong> and <strong>Medie</strong